[Music]  being a chef for me  is the only thing i could imagine me  doing in my life  people ask me what do you do when you're  not cooking  cooking  my name is pam i'm a chef in bangkok  and i have a restaurant in my home  called the table  i cater one table a night they can  request whatever they want no  restrictions  at first it started off with the people  that i know my friends my friends are  friends  the waiting list now is three months  [Music]  john george is a famous chef  and he owns a three-star michelin  restaurant in new york which i used to  work at  i decided to come back to bangkok and  open my own restaurant  and i didn't open a restaurant  instead i invite people to my own house  [Music]  today my guests request called crab  pasta  and beef wellington  i will go shopping for ingredients  [Music]  i try to focus on local produce  bangkok is a very special place for a  chef because there's thousands and  thousands of ingredients here and the  flavor of each ingredient is really  distinctive  and then i will come back home and  prepare it a day ahead  i usually finish about 80 of the food so  when the guests come nothing is chaotic  in the kitchen anymore everything is set  [Music]  i got two helpers in the kitchen  and service people for front of the  house  everything is clean and ready to serve  [Music]  i'm glad that people see that i'm  successful but i don't think that i'm  successful to the top yet  if you think you're successful you'll  stop learning  being a chef or being a cook you always  have to learn new things  [Music]  i just love what i do i think it comes  out in the food  if people come here and they go back  with smile and  full stomach  i'm just happy  being a chef is not a job for me it's my  passion  [Music]  [Laughter]  you

